## Directory Structure

```
docs/
├── INDEX.md                          # Documentation hub (START HERE)
├── SIDEBAR.md                        # Navigation menu
├── QUICK_START.md                    # 5-min quickstart
├── API_REFERENCE.md                  # Built-in functions
├── language/
│   └── SYNTAX.md                     # Complete language reference
├── architecture/
│   └── COMPILER_ARCHITECTURE.md      # 6-stage compilation pipeline
├── compiler/
│   ├── TYPE_SYSTEM.md                # Type inference & checking
│   ├── DEFTYPE_DEFSTRUCT_IMPLEMENTATION.md
│   └── DEFMODIFIER_IMPLEMENTATION.md
├── development/
│   ├── IMPLEMENTATION_GUIDE.md        # How to add features
│   ├── REPL_GUIDE.md                  # Interactive REPL
│   ├── BUG_FIXES_SUMMARY.md           # Recent improvements
│   ├── TEST_CONSOLIDATION.md          # Testing infrastructure
│   └── TODO.md                        # Progress & tasks
├── planning/
│   └── ROADMAP.md                    # Future directions
└── history/
    └── CHANGELOG.md                  # Timeline of changes
```

